From: Paul B Mahol <onemda@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] avformat: add hvqm4 demuxer

The HVQM4 demuxer from Paul B Mahol's patch series "HVQM4" on ffmpeg-devel, 9 July 2023
(https://ffmpeg.org/pipermail/ffmpeg-devel/2023-July/311852.html, 0001-avformat-add-hvqm4-demuxer.patch),
never merged into FFmpeg. Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or later, as FFmpeg is.

Changed by Charlie Bruce for the nightfire-cxbx project, 26 October 2026 (the changes are also listed at the top of
libavformat/hvqm4dec.c):
 - ported to FFmpeg 8.1 (FFInputFormat; the audio decoder it names, adpcm_ima_hvqm4, is in FFmpeg since 8.1);
 - the blocks are read in order, each frame checked against its block's size, in place of a list of blocks found
   by position;
 - video timestamps from each frame's display number, audio timestamps and durations from the sample counts;
 - no audio stream when the file has none; only the ADPCM audio format (0) is mapped;
 - the file header is passed to the decoder as extradata.
Applies to FFmpeg n8.1.3.

diff -uN a/libavformat/Makefile b/libavformat/Makefile
--- a/libavformat/Makefile
+++ b/libavformat/Makefile
@@ -273,6 +273,7 @@
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_HLS_DEMUXER)               += hls.o hls_sample_encryption.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_HLS_MUXER)                 += hlsenc.o hlsplaylist.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_HNM_DEMUXER)               += hnm.o
+OBJS-$(CONFIG_HVQM4_DEMUXER)             += hvqm4dec.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_HXVS_DEMUXER)              += hxvs.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_IAMF_DEMUXER)              += iamfdec.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_IAMF_MUXER)                += iamfenc.o
diff -uN a/libavformat/allformats.c b/libavformat/allformats.c
--- a/libavformat/allformats.c
+++ b/libavformat/allformats.c
@@ -216,6 +216,7 @@
 extern const FFInputFormat  ff_hls_demuxer;
 extern const FFOutputFormat ff_hls_muxer;
 extern const FFInputFormat  ff_hnm_demuxer;
+extern const FFInputFormat  ff_hvqm4_demuxer;
 extern const FFInputFormat  ff_hxvs_demuxer;
 extern const FFInputFormat  ff_iamf_demuxer;
 extern const FFOutputFormat ff_iamf_muxer;
diff -uN a/libavformat/hvqm4dec.c b/libavformat/hvqm4dec.c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libavformat/hvqm4dec.c
@@ -0,0 +1,219 @@
